    "raw": "---\ntitle: \"Stage to Publish: Testing the Automated Pipeline\"\ndate: \"2026-05-27\"\ndescription: \"Testing the automated stage-to-publish flow.\"\ntags: [\"pipeline\", \"automation\", \"test\"]\npublished: false\n---\n\n# Stage to Publish: Pipeline Test\n\nThis post verifies the automated publishing pipeline end-to-end.\n\n## What This Tests\n\n1. **Staging** — post pushed to portfolio repo with published: false\n2. **Review** — accessible via direct URL, hidden from index/RSS\n3. **Auto-publish** — at scheduledAt, Hermes flips published: true and posts to LinkedIn with PDF carousel\n\n## The Flow\n\nWrite once. Blog post + LinkedIn carousel, fully automated, on schedule.\n\n*Auto-generated by OpenClaw pipeline.*\n"
